{{!-- Share actions, in the two shapes the design draws them.

	{{> "post/share"}}              the row that closes the article: copy, email, Bluesky
	{{> "post/share" rail=true}}    the rail's pair: copy, email

The design draws three buttons and gives them nothing to do. Here they do the thing they are
labelled with, because a button that looks live and is dead is worse than no button:

  - Copy link asks the clipboard, and swaps its own label for a moment. It needs script, so it
	is the only one that is a <button> — and it carries `x-cloak`, so with scripting off it is
	not there at all rather than styled and dead, which is the same rule stated the other way
	round. `navigator.clipboard` is also unavailable over plain http on a non-localhost origin,
	and the catch in `postShare` is what keeps the label honest there. `aria-live` on the button
	is what carries the label change to a reader who cannot see it.
  - Email and Bluesky are links, because they are navigations. {{encode}} is Ghost's own URL
	encoder and {{url absolute="true"}} the canonical address of this post — a relative one
	would arrive in someone's inbox pointing at nothing.

Both shapes carry their own button sizing rather than sharing a variable: the sizes are
literal in the source because the class scanner only ever sees what is written here. --}}
{{#if rail}}
	<div
		x-data="postShare('{{url absolute="true"}}')"
		class="pt-5">
		<p class="text-muted mb-3 font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">{{t "Share"}}</p>

		<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
			<button
				type="button"
				x-cloak
				aria-live="polite"
				x-on:click="copy()"
				class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 cursor-pointer rounded-sm border px-3 py-2 text-[12.5px] font-semibold">
				<span x-show="!copied">{{t "Copy link"}}</span>
				<span
					x-show="copied"
					x-cloak>{{t "Copied"}}</span>
			</button>

			<a
				href="mailto:?subject={{encode title}}&amp;body={{url absolute="true"}}"
				class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 rounded-sm border px-3 py-2 text-[12.5px] font-semibold no-underline">{{t "Email"}}</a>
		</div>
	</div>
{{else}}
	<div
		x-data="postShare('{{url absolute="true"}}')"
		class="border-border mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border-t pt-7">
		<span class="text-muted mr-1.5 font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">{{t "Share"}}</span>

		<button
			type="button"
			x-cloak
			aria-live="polite"
			x-on:click="copy()"
			class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 cursor-pointer rounded-sm border px-[15px] py-[9px] text-[13px] font-semibold">
			<span x-show="!copied">{{t "Copy link"}}</span>
			<span
				x-show="copied"
				x-cloak>{{t "Copied"}}</span>
		</button>

		<a
			href="mailto:?subject={{encode title}}&amp;body={{url absolute="true"}}"
			class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 rounded-sm border px-[15px] py-[9px] text-[13px] font-semibold no-underline">{{t "Email"}}</a>

		<a
			href="https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text={{encode title}}%20{{url absolute="true"}}"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener"
			class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 rounded-sm border px-[15px] py-[9px] text-[13px] font-semibold no-underline">{{t "Bluesky"}}</a>
	</div>
{{/if}}
